.TH CHTTP_BODY 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
CHTTP_BODY \- construct a chttp_request_body_t with an explicit content type
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/chttp.h>

CHTTP_BODY(data_ptr, data_len, content_type_str)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
This macro expands to an initializer for a chttp_request_body_t from
the raw data pointer, the length and the Content-Type string that you
give it.

data_ptr       A pointer to the body bytes. The macro does not copy
               them.
data_len       The length of the body in bytes.
content_type_str  The value string of the Content-Type header.
.fi
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
chttp_request_body_t body = CHTTP_BODY(buf, len, "application/octet-stream");
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR CHTTP_JSON_BODY (3),
.BR CHTTP_TEXT_BODY (3),
.BR CHTTP_NO_BODY (3)
